= Technology =
Technology concerns tools, engineered systems, techniques, infrastructure, computation, and applied knowledge.

== BITwiki focus ==
BITwiki is particularly interested in technologies that interact with systems science, artificial intelligence, knowledge systems, cryptography, automation, energy, electronics, and scientific instrumentation.

